{{Quote|"Why'd you pick that lame-o alien? He's, like, the worst!"<br>He's not ''like'' the worst. He ''is'' The Worst."|[[Toolboxx]] and The Worst.<ref name="IaMMMBWP1" />}}
'''The Worst''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of an [[Atrocian]] originally from the planet [[Atrocius 0]].{{Refn|[[:File:Atrocius 0 Proof.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

==Appearance==
The Worst is a yellow, fat, round blob-like alien who wears a pair of green underwear with white stripes on it. He has elephant-like feet with three toes, and bear-like hands with three claws, which are like thick, blunt nails.{{Refn|[[:File:The Worst Claws.png]]|group = DJW|name = claws}} He also has wart-like bumps on his forehead and both arms.

The Worst's [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol is located on his outstretched belly button.

==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow">
NHAB (185).png|Enhanced Durability
IaMBW1 (239).png|Heat Resistance
</gallery>
{{Quote|Smart move, bro! Atrocians are indestructible!|[[Rook Blonko|Rook]]'s reaction to seeing [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] turn into The Worst.<ref name="NHAB">''[[No Honor Among Bros]]''</ref>}}
The Worst is nearly impervious to physical harm; he is able to withstand heavy physical attacks, and energy attacks such as [[Exo-Skull|Exo-Skull]]'s laser<ref name="IaMMMBWP1">''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]''</ref> due to his soft, blob-like body.<ref>[[Rook Blonko]]</ref><ref name="NHAB" />{{Refn|[[:File:The Worst's Skin.png]]|group = DJW}}.

The Worst has malleable skin, allowing him to absorb any physical impacts.<ref name="NHAB" />

The Worst is resistant against extreme heat<ref name="IaMMMBWP1" /> and immune to lava.<ref>''[[The Most Dangerous Game Show]]''</ref>

The Worst is naturally resistant to poisons.{{Refn|[[:File:Atrocian v poison.png]]|group = DJW|name = poison}}

The Worst has enhanced strength.<ref name="NHAB" />

==Weaknesses==
{{Quote|I said you were indestructible. I didn't say it wouldn't hurt.|Rook to The Worst during the latter's fight with [[Mallice]].<ref name="NHAB" />}}
Despite his incredible durability, The Worst still feels pain completely.

The Worst lacks any offensive options, basically becoming a punching bag for any capable enemy. In general, he has many attributes that could hinder him in battle.{{refn|[[:File:Atrocian Attributes.png]]|group = DJW}}

Though he is resistant to poisons, The Worst is not immune.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = poison}}

The Worst needs oxygen to breathe, meaning that he can neither breathe underwater nor survive in the vacuum of space.{{Refn|[[:File:Atrocians Need to Breathe.png]]|group = DJW}}

The Worst is vulnerable to being possessed by an [[Ectonurite (Classic)|Ectonurite]].{{Refn|[[:File:Ectonurites Can Possess Atrocians & Polymorphs.png]]|group = DJW}}

Like other organic beings, The Worst is vulnerable to being aged to dust by the time rays of a [[Chronosapien]] or a [[Chronian]], though it would take a while due to all the dead skin and calluses.{{Refn|[[:File:The Worst Affected by Time Rays.png]]|group = DJW}}

The Worst can be killed by something that disintegrates organic material,{{Refn|[[:File:Way To Kill An Atrocian.png]]|group = DJW}} for example, the [[Non-Baryonic Disruptor Chamber]].

==History==
===Omniverse===
*The Worst first appeared in ''[[Outbreak]]'', where he was accidentally unlocked by [[Blukic]] and [[Driba]] when they were trying to fix the Omnitrix and tried to stop [[Liam]], [[Fistina]], [[Bubble Helmet]], and [[Psyphon]] along with a group of [[Plumbers]].
*In ''[[No Honor Among Bros]]'', The Worst defeated [[Mallice]] by taking so much of a beating that the latter became exhausted and lost.
*In ''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]'', The Worst was tossed into [[Exo-Skull|Exo-Skull]]'s horn by [[Toolboxx]], causing them [[Maltruant]], [[Dr. Psychobos]], and [[Subdora]] to be transported to [[Mad Ben|Mad Ben]]'s [[Mad World|timeline]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', The Worst appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

