==Trivia==
*The Worst is one of four aliens unlocked by [[Driba]] and [[Blukic]]; the other three being [[Walkatrout]], [[Pesky Dust]], and [[Mole-Stache]].<ref>''[[Outbreak]]''</ref>
*Notably, all The Worst's appearances were unintentional transformations. As such, not only is he the only alien into whom [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] never intentionally transforms, but he is also the only alien into whom Ben never actively tries to transform.
*The Worst comes from the same planet as [[Ball Weevil]].{{Refn|[[:File:Ball Weevil and The Worst Same Planet.png]]|group = DJW}}
*The Worst is Ben's least favorite alien.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben's Least Favorite Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
*In his first appearance, The Worst shared the same voice as Ben due to the Omnitrix malfunctioning. The out-of-universe reason was because the crew originally did not envision him as a usable alien for later episodes.{{Refn|[[:File:Outbreak Alien Voices Explaination.png]]|group = DJW}} The Worst's voice was eventually changed in ''No Honor Among Bros'' because the crew liked how he turned out.{{Refn|[[:File:Outbreak Alien Voices Changed.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Sharpened [[Taydenite]] could possibly break The Worst's skin.{{Refn|[[:File:Atrocian Durability Limit.png]]|group = DJW}}
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] came up with the idea of The Worst being indestructible, yet still feeling pain.{{Refn|[[:File:The Worst's powers were Derrick's idea.png]]|group = DJW}}
*[[Albedo]] is unable to transform into The Worst.{{Refn|[[:File:Albedo Does Not Have Outbreak Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Like all the other Atrocians, The Worst was based on [[Jae Hong Kim]]'s storyboards, as that's the way he would draw aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:Worsts based on Jae Kim's Boards.png]]|group = DJW}}
*The Worst was among the aliens considered to be featured in the [[Ben 10 (2016 TV Series)|Reboot]].{{Refn|[[:File:Omniverse Aliens Considered for Reboot.png]]|group = DR}}

